# b25e48e + our patch series: two hunks differed only because b25e48e's NmbSampler already holds its index Ownership, so the
# device the encoder checks is the struct's third field (sampler.2) instead of the second; every other hunk is ee2ef0d3's,
# unchanged. The encoder pins buffers and checks a buffer mapping is writable before it encodes a handle or hands out
# constant data. Applies after shader_priming_v2.
